OL,3,GNEWSAGirl to run race for brother's
OL,4,Aswimming charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old girl will take on the
OL,7,FJunior Great South Run to raise funds
OL,8,Ffor her older brother's swimming
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,FLily, from Byfleet in Surrey, has
OL,12,Falready raised more than #2,000 through
OL,13,Fher online fundraiser, ahead of the run
OL,14,Fon 17 October.
OL,16,FTroy, 21, said he was inspired by his
OL,17,Fsister, who has Down's syndrome, to set
OL,18,Fup SEN UK Swimming, which trains
OL,19,Fswimming teachers to better support
OL,20,Fchildren with special educational
OL,21,Fneeds.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
